ot found.'=>'找不到操作隨機數。','Invalid action nonce.'=>'無效的操作隨機數。','Editorial Comments'=>'編輯評論','Choose Post Types'=>'選擇文章類型','<p>Editorial comments help you cut down on email overload and keep the conversation close to where it matters: your content. Threaded commenting in the admin, similar to what you find at the end of a blog post, allows writers and editors to privately leave feedback and discuss what needs to be changed before publication.</p><p>Anyone with access to view the story in progress will also have the ability to comment on it. If you have notifications enabled, those following the post will receive an email every time a comment is left.</p>'=>'<p>編輯評論幫助您減少電子郵件過載，並讓對話集中在重要的地方：您的內容。類似於博客文章結尾的串接評論，使作者和編輯能夠私下留下反饋並討論在出版前需要更改的內容。</p><p>任何有權查看進行中故事的人也將能夠對其進行評論。如果您啟用了通知，跟隨該文章的人在每次留下評論時將收到電子郵件。</p>','<p><strong>For more information:</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/editorial-comments/">Editorial Comments Documentation</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress on Github</a></p>'=>'<p><strong>欲了解更多資訊：</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/editorial-comments/">編輯評論文檔</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress 在 Github</a></p>','Remove'=>'移除','All Posts'=>'所有文章','All Users'=>'所有用戶','Search results for &#8220;%s&#8221;'=>'搜尋結果 &#8220;%s&#8221;','Search Comments'=>'搜尋評論','You can add editorial comments to a post once you\'ve saved it for the first time.'=>'您可以在第一次保存文章後添加編輯評論。','Add an editorial comment'=>'添加編輯評論','Attach file'=>'附加檔案','Add Comment'=>'添加評論','Reply to this comment'=>'回覆此評論','Reply'=>'回覆','Delete'=>'刪除','said on %1$s at %2$s'=>'於 %1$s 在 %2$s 說','Nonce check failed. Please ensure you\'re supposed to be adding editorial comments.'=>'Nonce 檢查失敗。請確保您有權添加編輯評論。','Invalid comment data'=>'無效的評論數據','Sorry, you don\'t have the privileges to add editorial comments. Please talk to your Administrator.'=>'抱歉，您沒有權限添加編輯評論。請與您的管理員聯繫。','Please enter a comment.'=>'請輸入評論。','There was a problem of some sort. Try again or contact your administrator.'=>'發生了一些問題。請重試或聯繫您的管理員。','Nonce check failed. Please ensure you\'re supposed to be editing editorial comments.'=>'Nonce 檢查失敗。請確保您有權編輯編輯評論。','Sorry, you don\'t have the privileges to edit editorial comments. Please talk to your Administrator.'=>'抱歉，您沒有權限編輯編輯評論。請與您的管理員聯繫。','Sorry, you don\'t have the privileges to edit this editorial comment. Please talk to your Administrator.'=>'抱歉，您沒有權限編輯此編輯評論。請聯繫您的管理員。','Sorry, you don\'t have the privileges to delete this editorial comment. Please talk to your Administrator.'=>'抱歉，您沒有權限刪除此編輯評論。請聯繫您的管理員。','Sorry, you can\'t delete this editorial comment because it has some replies.'=>'抱歉，您無法刪除這條編輯評論，因為它有一些回覆。','Comment deleted successfully.'=>'評論已成功刪除。','Enable for these post types:'=>'為這些貼文類型啟用：','Comment author name field:'=>'評論作者名稱欄位：','Nickname'=>'暱稱','Username'=>'用戶名','Display Name'=>'顯示名稱','First Name'=>'名','Last Name'=>'姓','Email'=>'電子郵件','User Url'=>'用戶網址','No editorial comments.'=>'沒有編輯評論。','Filter by post'=>'按帖子篩選','Filter by user'=>'按用戶篩選','Filter'=>'篩選','Comment'=>'評論','Post'=>'貼文','Submitted on'=>'提交於','%1$s at %2$s'=>'%1$s 在 %2$s','Editorial fields term added.'=>'編輯欄位術語已添加。','Editorial fields term updated.'=>'編輯欄位術語已更新。','Editorial fields term doesn\'t exist.'=>'編輯欄位術語不存在。','Editorial fields term deleted.'=>'編輯欄位術語已刪除。','Editorial fields order updated.'=>'編輯欄位順序已更新。','Editorial fields visibility changed.'=>'編輯欄位可見性已變更。','<p>Keep track of important details about your content with editorial fields. This feature allows you to create as many date, text, number, etc. fields as you like, and then use them to store information like contact details or the location of an interview.</p><p>Once you’ve set your fields up, editorial fields integrates with both the calendar and the content overview. Make an editorial fields item visible to have it appear to the rest of your team. Keep it hidden to restrict the information between the writer and their editor.</p>'=>'<p>使用編輯欄位跟蹤有關您內容的重要細節。這個功能允許您創建任意數量的日期、文本、數字等欄位，然後用來存儲聯絡資訊或訪談地點等信息。</p><p>一旦設置了您的欄位，編輯欄位將與日曆和內容概覽整合。將編輯欄位項目設為可見，以便讓您的團隊其他成員看到。保持隱藏可限制作家與編輯之間的信息。</p>','<p><strong>For more information:</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/editorial-metadata/">Editorial Fields Documentation</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress on Github</a></p>'=>'<p><strong>欲了解更多信息：</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/editorial-metadata/">編輯欄位文檔</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">Github上的PublishPress</a></p>','First Draft Date'=>'初稿日期','When the first draft needs to be ready.'=>'初稿需要準備好的時間。','Assignment'=>'任務','What the post needs to cover.'=>'該文章需要覆蓋的內容。','Checkbox'=>'複選框','Dropdown Select'=>'下拉選擇','Location'=>'地點','Number'=>'數字','Paragraph'=>'段落','Text'=>'文本','User'=>'用戶','Are you sure you want to delete this term? Any metadata for this term will remain but will not be visible unless this term is re-added.'=>'您確定要刪除此術語嗎？此術語的任何元數據將保留，但除非重新添加此術語，否則將無法顯示。','Search Editorial Fields'=>'搜索編輯欄位','Popular Editorial Fields'=>'熱門編輯欄位','All Editorial Fields'=>'所有編輯欄位','Edit Editorial Fields'=>'編輯編輯欄位','Update Editorial Fields'=>'更新編輯欄位','Add New Editorial Fields'=>'新增編輯欄位','New Editorial Fields'=>'新的編輯欄位','No editorial fields available.'=>'沒有可用的編輯欄位。',' <a href="%s">Add fields to get started</a>.'=>' <a href="%s">新增欄位以開始使用</a>。',' Encourage your site administrator to configure your editorial workflow by adding editorial fields.'=>'鼓勵您的網站管理員通過添加編輯欄位來配置您的編輯工作流程。','All options value and labels are required.'=>'所有選項的值和標籤都是必填的。','Please enter a name for the editorial fields.'=>'請為編輯欄位輸入一個名稱。','Please enter a slug for the editorial fields.'=>'請為編輯欄位輸入一個短語。','Name conflicts with existing term. Please choose another.'=>'名稱與現有術語衝突。請選擇其他名稱。','Name already in use. Please choose another.'=>'名稱已被使用。請選擇其他名稱。','Slug already in use. Please choose another.'=>'短語已被使用。請選擇其他短語。','Name cannot exceed 200 characters. Please try a shorter name.'=>'名稱不能超過200個字元。請嘗試一個更短的名稱。','Please select a valid metadata type.'=>'請選擇一個有效的元數據類型。','Error adding term.'=>'新增術語時發生錯誤。','Please enter a name for the editorial fields'=>'請為編輯欄位輸入一個名稱','Please enter a valid, non-numeric name for the editorial fields.'=>'請為編輯欄位輸入一個有效的、非數字的名稱。','Metadata name conflicts with existing term. Please choose another.'=>'元數據名稱與現有術語衝突。請選擇其他名稱。','Name conflicts with slug for another term. Please choose something else.'=>'名稱與另一個術語的短語衝突。請選擇其他名稱。','Error updating term.'=>'更新術語時發生錯誤。','Terms not set.'=>'未設定條款。','Error deleting term.'=>'刪除條款時出錯。','Register editorial fields for these post types:'=>'為這些文章類型註冊編輯欄位：','No'=>'否','Yes'=>'是','This editorial fields type is not yet supported.'=>'此編輯欄位類型尚不支援。','Not set'=>'未設定','View &#8220;%s&#8221; on Google Maps'=>'在 Google 地圖上查看 &#8220;%s&#8221;','-- Select %s --'=>'-- 選擇 %s --','-- Select a user --'=>'-- 選擇一位用戶 --','Position'=>'職位','Name'=>'姓名','Post Types'=>'帖子類型','Field Type'=>'欄位類型','Description'=>'描述','No editorial fields found.'=>'找不到編輯欄位。','The name is for labeling the editorial fields.'=>'名稱用於標籤編輯欄位。','Slug'=>'別名','The slug cannot be changed once the term has been created.'=>'一旦條款創建後，別名無法更改。','The description can be used to communicate with your team about what the field is for.'=>'描述可用於與您的團隊交流該欄位的用途。','Type'=>'類型','The field type cannot be changed once created.'=>'一旦創建，欄位類型不能更改。','User role'=>'使用者角色','Select roles...'=>'選擇角色...','Filter the list of users in the editorial meta to users in the selected roles.'=>'將編輯元數據中用戶的列表過濾為所選角色的用戶。','Select Type'=>'選擇類型','Single Select'=>'單選','Multiple Select'=>'多選','Indicate the select type.'=>'指出選擇類型。','Dropdown Option'=>'下拉選項','Enter the dropdown option value and label. You can move options to change their order.'=>'輸入下拉選項的值和標籤。您可以移動選項以更改其順序。','Meta Value'=>'元值','Display Label'=>'顯示標籤','Default option'=>'預設選項','Add Another Option'=>'添加另一個選項','Show on Content Calendar and Overview form'=>'在內容日曆和概覽表單中顯示','If enabled, this field will be available when adding new posts on the Content Calendar and Overview screen.'=>'如果啟用，則在內容日曆和概覽畫面中添加新文章時，此欄位將可用。','Add to post types'=>'添加到文章類型','This field will be available for these post types.'=>'這個欄位將適用於這些文章類型。','Show on Post Types screen'=>'在文章類型畫面中顯示','This field will be viewable on the overview screens for these post types.'=>'這個欄位將在這些文章類型的概覽畫面中可見。','Update Editorial fields term'=>'更新編輯欄位術語','The "slug" is the URL-friendly version of the name. It is usually all lowercase and contains only letters, numbers, and hyphens.'=>'"slug" 是名稱的 URL 友好版本。它通常全部小寫，並且只包含字母、數字和連字符。','The description can be used to communicate with your team about what the metadata is for.'=>'描述可用於與您的團隊交流元數據的用途。','Indicate the type of editorial fields.'=>'指出編輯欄位的類型。','Add New Editorial fields term'=>'新增編輯欄位術語','Edit Flow should not be used alongside PublishPress Planner. If you want to use PublishPress Planner, please complete Edit Flow data migration and then deactivate Edit Flow.'=>'編輯流程不應與 PublishPress Planner 一起使用。如果您想使用 PublishPress Planner，請完成編輯流程數據遷移，然後停用編輯流程。','Advanced Notifications'=>'高級通知','Duplicated notification threshold:'=>'重複通知閾值：','Default notification channels:'=>'預設通知頻道：','Existing Post is updated'=>'現有文章已更新','New Post is created in Draft status'=>'新文章已在草稿狀態中創建','New Post is Published'=>'新文章已發布','Notify on editorial comments'=>'對編輯評論發送通知','minutes'=>'分鐘','This will prevent too many notifications being sent for the same or similar events. Set this to a higher number if you are receiving duplicate emails.'=>'這將防止為相同或相似事件發送過多通知。如果您收到重複電子郵件，請將此設置為更高的數字。','Editorial Notifications'=>'編輯通知','Choose the channels where each workflow will send notifications to:'=>'選擇每個工作流程將發送通知的頻道：','Muted'=>'靜音','Workflows'=>'工作流程','Channels'=>'頻道','Notifications Log'=>'通知日誌','Workflow Settings'=>'工作流程設定','Options'=>'選項','Help'=>'幫助','When to notify?'=>'何時通知？','For which content?'=>'針對哪個內容？','Who to notify?'=>'誰需要通知？','What to say?'=>'要說什麼？','Select at least one option for each section.'=>'每個部分至少選擇一個選項。','You can add dynamic information to the Subject or Body text using the following shortcodes:'=>'您可以使用以下短代碼將動態信息添加到主題或正文文本中：','Editorial Comment'=>'編輯評論','User making changes or comments'=>'進行更改或評論的用戶','Workflow'=>'工作流程','Format'=>'格式','Receiver'=>'接收者','shortcode'=>'短代碼','field'=>'欄位','On each shortcode, you can select one or more fields. If more than one, they will be displayed separated by ", ".'=>'在每個短代碼上，您可以選擇一個或多個欄位。如果選擇多個欄位，它們將以 ", " 分隔顯示。','Available fields'=>'可用欄位','Meta fields'=>'元欄位','Click here to read more about shortcode options...'=>'點擊這裡以了解更多有關短代碼選項的資訊...','Features'=>'功能','Feel free to select only the features you need.'=>'隨意選擇您所需的功能。','Enabled features'=>'啟用的功能','Invalid receiver for the notification'=>'通知的接收者無效','Invalid channel for the notification'=>'通知的通道無效','Notification log not found'=>'未找到通知日誌','The parent log was deleted or probably rescheduled'=>'父日誌已被刪除或可能已重新排程','Workflow: %s'=>'工作流程：%s','User: %s (%d)'=>'用戶：%s (%d)','Post type: %s'=>'帖子類型：%s','Post ID: %d'=>'帖子 ID：%d','Blog ID: %d'=>'部落格 ID：%d','Scheduled for %d receivers. Click here to display them.'=>'已排程給 %d 個接收者。點擊這裡顯示它們。',' Scheduled, but late'=>'已排程，但延遲',' Scheduled'=>'已排程','Error'=>'錯誤','The notification was set as "Scheduled" but the cron task is not found'=>'通知已設置為「已排程」，但找不到 cron 任務','Sent'=>'已發送','Skipped'=>'已跳過','asynchronous'=>'非同步','synchronous'=>'同步','Reschedule'=>'重新排程','Blog: '=>'部落格: ','Delete All'=>'刪除全部','All'=>'全部','Success'=>'成功','Filter by workflow'=>'按工作流程篩選','Filter by event'=>'按事件篩選','All events'=>'所有事件','Filter by channel'=>'按頻道篩選','All channels'=>'所有頻道','From date'=>'開始日期','To date'=>'結束日期','Filter by receiver'=>'按接收者篩選','All Receivers'=>'所有接收者','All Workflows'=>'所有工作流程','All Actions'=>'所有動作','All Channels'=>'所有頻道','All Statuses'=>'所有狀態','Notification'=>'通知','%s notification found.'=>'%s 條通知找到。','No notifications found.'=>'未找到通知。','This notification is very similar to another one sent less than %d minutes ago for the same receiver'=>'此通知與不久前發送給相同接收者的另一個通知非常相似，時間少於 %d 分鐘。','Subject:'=>'主旨:','Content:'=>'內容:','This is a preview of the scheduled message. The content can still change until the notification is sent.'=>'這是預定消息的預覽。內容仍然可以在通知發送之前更改。','Notifications'=>'通知','<p>Notifications ensure you keep up to date with progress your most important content. Users can be subscribed to notifications on a post one by one or by selecting roles.</p><p>When enabled, notifications can be sent when a post changes status or an editorial comment is left by a writer or an editor.</p>'=>'<p>通知確保您隨時了解您最重要內容的進展。用戶可以逐一訂閱文章的通知或通過選擇角色進行訂閱。</p><p>啟用後，當文章狀態變更或作家或編輯留下編輯評論時，可以發送通知。</p>','<p><strong>For more information:</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/notifications/">Notifications Documentation</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress on Github</a></p>'=>'<p><strong>欲了解更多信息：</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/notifications/">通知文檔</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">Github上的PublishPress</a></p>','Notify User'=>'通知用戶','Notify Users'=>'通知用戶','Notify Role'=>'通知角色','Notify Roles'=>'通知角色','Notification Group'=>'通知群組','Notification Groups'=>'通知群組','Notify Email'=>'通知電子郵件','Notify Emails'=>'通知電子郵件','Click to stop being notified on updates for this post'=>'點擊以停止接收此帖的更新通知','Stop notifying me'=>'停止通知我','Click to start being notified on updates for this post'=>'點擊以開始接收此帖的更新通知','Notify me'=>'通知我','Enter users, roles, or email addresses that should receive notifications for this post.'=>'輸入應該接收此帖文通知的使用者、角色或電子郵件地址。','Show active notifications'=>'顯示活動通知','This won\'t have any effect unless you have at least one workflow targeting the "Users who selected "Notify me" for the content" option.'=>'除非您至少有一個工作流程針對 "為內容選擇 "通知我" 的使用者" 選項，否則這將不會有任何效果。','Active Notifications'=>'活動通知','Workflow has users enrolled'=>'工作流程已經有用戶註冊','No active notifications found for this %s.'=>'未找到此 %s 的有效通知。','You are receiving this email because you are subscribed to "%s".'=>'您收到此電子郵件是因為您訂閱了 "%s"。','This email was sent %s.'=>'此電子郵件於 %s 發送。','Show the "Notify me" and "Stop notifying me" links for these post types:'=>'顯示這些帖子類型的 "通知我" 和 "停止通知我" 連結：','Email from:'=>'來自電子郵件：','Always notify the author of the content:'=>'始終通知內容的作者：','Always notify users who have edited the content:'=>'始終通知編輯過內容的用戶：','Blacklisted taxonomies for Notifications'=>'通知的黑名單分類法','slug1,slug2'=>'slug1,slug2','Add a list of taxonomy-slugs separated by comma that should not be loaded by the Taxonomy content filter when adding a new Notification Workflow.'=>'添加一個以逗號分隔的分類標籤列表，這些標籤在添加新的通知工作流程時不應由分類內容過濾器加載。','WordPress Scheduler'=>'WordPress 排程器','[%1$s] New %2$s Created: "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] 新的 %2$s 已創建："%3$s"','A new %1$s (#%2$s "%3$s" ) was created by %4$s %5$s'=>'新的 %1$s (#%2$s "%3$s") 由 %4$s %5$s 創建','[%1$s] %2$s Trashed: "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s 已移至垃圾桶："%3$s"','%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" was moved to the trash by %4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" 被 %4$s %5$s 移至垃圾桶','[%1$s] %2$s Restored (from Trash ): "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s 從垃圾桶恢復："%3$s"','%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" was restored from trash by %4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" 被 %4$s %5$s 從垃圾桶恢復','[%1$s] %2$s Published: "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s 已發布："%3$s"','%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" was published by %4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" 由 %4$s %5$s 發布','[%1$s] %2$s Unpublished: "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s 未發佈: "%3$s"','%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" was unpublished by %4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" 被 %4$s %5$s 未發佈','[%1$s] %2$s Status Changed for "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s 狀態已變更為 "%3$s"','Status was changed for %1$s #%2$s "%3$s" by %4$s %5$s'=>'狀態由 %4$s %5$s 變更為 %1$s #%2$s "%3$s"','This action was taken on %1$s at %2$s %3$s'=>'此操作於 %1$s 在 %2$s %3$s 執行','%1$s => %2$s'=>'%1$s => %2$s','== %s Details =='=>'== %s 詳細資訊 ==','Title: %s'=>'標題: %s','Author: %1$s (%2$s )'=>'作者: %1$s (%2$s )','== Actions =='=>'== 操作 ==','Add editorial comment: %s'=>'新增編輯評論: %s','Edit: %s'=>'編輯: %s','View: %s'=>'查看: %s','[%1$s] New Editorial Comment: "%2$s"'=>'[%1$s] 新增編輯評論: "%2$s"','A new editorial comment was ad